---
// Footer.astro - Clean professional Footer with Categorized Links and Legal Badges
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white no-print">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-12">
      <!-- Brand & Mission Column -->
      <div class="space-y-4 md:col-span-1">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#171717] flex items-center justify-center text-white">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
              <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
              <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
              <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
              <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-base tracking-tight text-slate-900">Invoice Free Maker</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          The fastest, 100% free online invoice maker with digital signatures, instant payment QR codes, and high-definition vector PDF export.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-[11px] font-mono bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-slate-500">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
          <span>100% Client-Side Private</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Document Tools Column -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 font-mono">Document Formats</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-500">
          <li><a href="#generator-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">GST / Tax Invoice Maker</a></li>
          <li><a href="#generator-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Proforma Invoice Generator</a></li>
          <li><a href="#generator-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Quotation & Estimate Maker</a></li>
          <li><a href="#generator-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Payment Receipt Voucher</a></li>
          <li><a href="#generator-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Purchase Order Generator</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Studio Tools Column -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 font-mono">Special Features</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-500">
          <li><a href="#generator-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Digital Signature Pad (Draw & Type)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#generator-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">UPI & PayPal QR Code Generator</a></li>
          <li><a href="#generator-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">160+ Multi-Currency Engine</a></li>
          <li><a href="#generator-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Number to English Words Converter</a></li>
          <li><a href="#generator-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Browser Invoices Vault & Backup</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Comparison & Guides -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 font-mono">Compare & Guides</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-500">
          <li><a href="#comparison-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Invoice Free Maker vs Refrens</a></li>
          <li><a href="#comparison-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Why Invoicing Software vs Excel</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">How to Add Digital Signatures</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">GST Invoicing Rules Explained</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq-section" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Privacy & Data Security</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright & Attribution -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Invoice Free Maker (<a href="https://invoicefreemaker.com" class="hover:underline text-slate-900">invoicefreemaker.com</a>). All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>No Sign-Up Required</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>No Watermark</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>100% Free Forever</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>